{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45577","headline":"富贵曲二首 一 · 贯休","name":"富贵曲二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有金张族，骄奢相续。\n琼树玉堂，雕墙绣毂。\n纨绮杂杂，钟鼓合合。\n美人如白牡丹花，半日只舞得一曲。\n乐不乐，足不足，争教他爱山青水绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45577.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45577","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}